  "releaseNotes": "- [ThunderPropagator#31] [Minor] DisconnectAsync race condition — transport closed before cancellation propagates causing ObjectDisposedException AbstractConnectionHandler.cs   - Replaced the recursive fire-and-forget ContinueWith loop with a proper async loop (RunReceiveLoopAsync) that takes a real CancellationToken   - Added _receivingCts (a per-connection CancellationTokenSource linked to _applicationLifetime.ApplicationStopping) and _backgroundTask to track the running loop   - Added DrainReceiveLoopAsync() — cancels the CTS and awaits the loop with a 500 ms timeout before it times out   - Updated DisposeManagedResourcesAsync to call DrainReceiveLoopAsync() before ConnectionInfo.DisposeAsync(), ensuring the in-flight read can observe cancellation before the transport is closed",
